<!-- WWF WrestleMania dedicated profile for the shared cabinet-confirmed
     Wolf/DCS master core. Runtime profile 1 selects the exact two-player,
     five-button controls, development-528 PIC response, 0x7FFD DSW default,
     and the five dynamic I/O shuffle tables used by the game executable.
     ROM data is user-supplied and CRC-checked. -->
